# Personal documents and parsed PII - never commit (see CLAUDE.md "Secrets & PII").
# The whole data root is ignored rather than each subdirectory: LocalStorage
# creates five of them (email_drafts, whatsapp_drafts, cv_profiles,
# job_postings, exports) and every new writer added to core/storage.py would
# otherwise be a silent gap until someone noticed. Allow-list explicitly if
# something under here ever needs tracking.
*_C_V.pdf
*_CV.pdf
cv_*.pdf
resume_*.pdf
careeragent_data/
